Package: rust-unityextractor
Version: 0.0.0-replaced-by-makefile
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Jérôme Poulin <jeromepoulin@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/ticpu/rust-unityextractor
Description: Extract assets from Unity packages
 Extracts the assets of a .unitypackage file to the working directory in a
 single pass, with bounded memory and parallel writes. The binary is
 statically linked.
